sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant CN as CN Central<br>[implements GapCentral]
    Product->>CN: GapCentral.RemoveAllBonds()
    CN-->>Product: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(0)
    Note over Product: Removes all stored bonds. The callback always reports 0<br>as the final bond count, regardless of the previous state.
